# Thematic Map {#sec-topicos}

Topics are **emergent** thematic categories assigned to each concept during coding. The treemap shows the relative share of each theme.

::: {#cell-fig-treemap .cell execution_count=9}
``` {.python .cell-code}
topic_counts = onto["topic"].value_counts().reset_index()
topic_counts.columns = ["Topic", "Concepts"]

fig = px.treemap(
    topic_counts,
    path=["Topic"],
    values="Concepts",
    color="Concepts",
    color_continuous_scale="Viridis",
    height=500,
)
fig.update_layout(template="plotly_white", font=dict(size=12))
fig.show()
```

