# Cross-tabulation: Topics vs Dimensions {#sec-heatmap}

Which topic concentrates concepts in which dimension? This heatmap reveals where knowledge is densest and where there are **gaps** worth future investigation.

::: {#cell-fig-heatmap .cell execution_count=10}
``` {.python .cell-code}
cross = onto.copy()
cross["dim_label"] = cross["dimension"].map(dim_labels)
cross = cross[cross["dimension"] != "0"]

pivot = cross.groupby(["topic", "dim_label"]).size().reset_index(name="count")
top_topics = topic_counts[topic_counts["Concepts"] >= 10]["Topic"].tolist()
pivot = pivot[pivot["topic"].isin(top_topics)]

heatmap_data = pivot.pivot(index="topic", columns="dim_label", values="count").fillna(0)

fig = px.imshow(
    heatmap_data,
    labels=dict(x="Acceptance dimension", y="Topic", color="Concepts"),
    color_continuous_scale="Blues",
    aspect="auto",
    text_auto=True,
    height=500,
)
fig.update_layout(template="plotly_white", font=dict(size=12))
fig.show()
```

