      <td id="T_5a032_row1_col6" class="data row1 col6" >Aspect 8 (Formative): planning and implementation of technology rollout. Primarily enables outcomes (energy technologies, employment) but contested by resistance. Co-occurs with acceptance, policy, infrastructure. Dimension 3: institutional planning and socio-political enabling conditions govern deployment scale and pace. High frequency (230) and broad sources (100) confirm central role.</td>
