      <td id="T_5a032_row5_col6" class="data row5 col6" >Aspect 8 (Formative): Represents systemic transformation planning and design. Primarily contested by incumbents, indicating governance challenge. Co-occurs with policy, public acceptance, and infrastructure development. Socio-political dimension: involves institutional coordination and societal-level change requiring multi-stakeholder governance.</td>
